                            	  3874: _L_z01_CheckLinkCollisionPreinit_FacingOpposite:
                            	  3875:     ; Link and the shot are facing opposite directions.
                            	  3876:     ; Link can parry certain weapons/shots.
                            	  3877:     ;
                            	  3878:     ; For flying rock, $54, arrow, and boomerang, this means
                            	  3879:     ; no harmful collision; but it still counts as a shot collision.
                            	  3880:     ; So, go treat this as a parry.
                            	  3881:     ;
